&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;documentation&#34;&gt;Documentation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;All relevant document can be found &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;docs/&#34; &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;scripts&#34;&gt;Scripts
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For easier usage, there are some scripts in the &lt;code&gt;scripts&lt;/code&gt; directory, that can be used to directly access the core functionality of MPV2, without the need of user interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All scripts need to be run from the root directory of the project, e.g. &lt;code&gt;bash scripts/upload_video.sh&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
